msgstr "**Osnova Qt Creator:** 14.0.2 (zajednička s OpenMV IDE-om)."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:123
msgid "**Bundled firmware:** v5.0.1."
msgstr "**Priloženi firmver:** v5.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:124
msgid ""
"**New boards and sensors:** OpenMV N6 Classic; FLIR Lepton 3.1R and UW."
msgstr "**Nove pločice i senzori:** OpenMV N6 Classic; FLIR Lepton 3.1R i UW."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:127
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.0.rst:129
msgid ""
"None. The JPG toggle in the frame buffer's title bar is now a JPG Mode / RAW"
" Mode selector."
msgstr ""
"Nema ih. Prekidač JPG u naslovnoj traci spremnika okvira sada je birač JPG "
"Mode / RAW Mode."
